Hospital teams

The group `Ward` holds `Nurse station` and `Bedside monitor`. The
`Bedside monitor` sends alarms to the `Nurse station`. The `Nurse station`
writes to `Records`. The team `Nursing` owns the `Ward`, and the team `IT` owns
`Records`, with the key `owner`. Show the seams by owner.
---
Ward { Nurse station, Bedside monitor }
Ward { owner: Nursing }
Records { owner: IT }
Bedside monitor -> Nurse station: alarm
Nurse station -> Records: write
show seams by owner
